{% doc %}
  @prompt
    ## Shopify Horizon AI Prompt – "Our Proven Shopify Growth Process" Section (Pixel-Perfect)
    
    Create a premium enterprise-style **"How It Works"** section that matches the attached reference as closely as possible. The layout, spacing, typography, sizing, and proportions should be nearly identical while replacing the static Shopify illustration with a **dynamic image upload** from the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    The design should feel modern, minimal, and premium, similar to Shopify Plus, Stripe, Linear, or Vercel.
    
    ---
    
    # Overall Layout
    
    * Full-width section
    * Max content width: **1320px**
    * Background: **#050505**
    * Section padding:
    
      * Desktop: **100px top & bottom**
      * Horizontal: **60px**
    * Two-column layout
    
      * Left column: **46%**
      * Right column: **54%**
    * Gap between columns: **70px**
    * Vertically centered
    * Responsive for tablet and mobile
    
    Add very thin vertical accent lines near the left and right edges of the section using **#B85C1C** at 40% opacity.
    
    ---
    
    # Top Badge
    
    Place a small rounded badge above the heading.
    
    Style
    
    * Height: 34px
    * Horizontal padding: 14px
    * Background: #111111
    * Border: 1px solid #232323
    * Border radius: 999px
    
    Content
    
    Small sparkle icon
    
    Text:
    
    **How It Works**
    
    Typography
    
    * Inter
    * 13px
    * Medium
    * White
    
    ---
    
    # Heading
    
    Large premium heading.
    
    Line One
    
    **Our Proven Shopify**
    
    Line Two
    
    **Growth Process**
    
    Typography
    
    * Font: Inter
    * Weight: 700
    * Size: 56px
    * Line height: 110%
    * Letter spacing: -1px
    
    Color
    
    White
    
    Highlight only
    
    **Growth Process**
    
    using
    
    **#FF7A1A**
    
    ---
    
    # Timeline
    
    Below the heading create four timeline items.
    
    Use a vertical connector line joining each icon.
    
    Timeline spacing
    
    * 34px between items
    
    ---
    
    ## Timeline Icon
    
    Circle
    
    * 38px × 38px
    * Border: 1px solid #355DFF
    * Background transparent
    * Icon color: #355DFF
    
    Icons
    
    Discovery → Target
    
    Planning → Clipboard
    
    Development → Code
    
    Launch → Headset
    
    ---
    
    ## Item Typography
    
    Title
    
    * 24px
    * SemiBold
    * White
    
    Body
    
    * 15px
    * Regular
    * #A7A7A7
    * Line height 170%
    
    ---
    
    ### Content
    
    #### Discovery & Strategy
    
    We analyze your business goals, target audience, competitors, and current store performance to create a growth-focused roadmap.
    
    ---
    
    #### UX & Store Planning
    
    Our team designs a conversion-focused user experience, wireframes key pages, and plans the ideal customer journey.
    
    ---
    
    #### Development & Migration
    
    We build, customize, or migrate your Shopify store with clean development practices and minimal disruption to your business.
    
    ---
    
    #### Launch & Growth Optimization
    
    After testing and launch, we continuously optimize speed, user experience, and conversions through ongoing data-driven improvements.
    
    ---
    
    # Right Side Dynamic Image Card
    
    Replace the Shopify logo illustration with a **merchant-uploaded image**.
    
    This image must be editable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    The merchant should be able to upload:
    
    * PNG
    * JPG
    * SVG
    * WebP
    
    without editing the code.
    
    ---
    
    ## Card Style
    
    Width
    
    Approximately **520px**
    
    Height
    
    Approximately **540px**
    
    Background
    
    #EEF2F3
    
    Border Radius
    
    28px
    
    Overflow
    
    Hidden
    
    Box Shadow
    
    0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.25)
    
    ---
    
    ## Image Container
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed inside the card.
    
    Requirements
    
    * Width: 100%
    * Height: 100%
    * Display: Flex
    * Align Items: Center
    * Justify Content: Center
    * Padding: 24px
    
    ---
    
    ## Image Behaviour
    
    This is extremely important.
    
    The uploaded image should always remain completely visible.
    
    Never crop it.
    
    Never zoom into it.
    
    Never stretch it.
    
    Maintain the original aspect ratio.
    
    Use
    
    ```
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: center;
    ```
    
    The image should automatically scale to fit within the card regardless of whether it is portrait, landscape, square, logo, mockup, or screenshot.
    
    If no image is uploaded, show a centered placeholder illustration.
    
    ---
    
    # Theme Editor Settings
    
    Create editable settings for:
    
    ✔ Image Picker
    
    ✔ Alt Text
    
    ✔ Card Background Color
    
    ✔ Card Border Radius
    
    ✔ Image Padding
    
    ✔ Image Scale
    
    ✔ Vertical Alignment
    
    ✔ Quote Text
    
    ✔ Badge Text
    
    ✔ Heading
    
    ✔ Timeline Items
    
    Everything should be editable through the Theme Editor.
    
    ---
    
    # Quote
    
    Centered underneath the image card.
    
    Font
    
    15px
    
    Italic
    
    Color
    
    #CFCFCF
    
    Text
    
    "Our agile process ensures rapid deployment while maintaining the highest standards of reliability and security."
    
    ---
    
    # Hover Effects
    
    Timeline Item
    
    * Translate Y: -4px
    * Transition: 0.3s ease
    * Title changes to #FF7A1A
    * Icon border glows slightly
    
    Image Card
    
    * Scale: 1.02
    * Soft shadow increases
    * Smooth transition
    
    ---
    
    # Mobile Layout
    
    Stack vertically.
    
    Heading first.
    
    Timeline second.
    
    Image card last.
    
    Card width
    
    100%
    
    Heading
    
    36px
    
    Timeline Icons
    
    32px
    
    Maintain generous spacing.
    
    ---
    
    # Development Requirements
    
    * Fully compatible with the latest **Shopify Horizon Theme**.
    * Use Shopify's native section architecture.
    * Do not hardcode any images.
    * The right-side visual must come from an **Image Picker** in the Theme Editor.
    * The uploaded image must always remain ful
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-growth-process-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1320px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_desktop }}px {{ block.settings.horizontal_padding }}px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-accent-line-left-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-growth-process-accent-line-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 1px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.accent_line_color }};
    opacity: {{ block.settings.accent_line_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
  }

  .ai-growth-process-accent-line-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    left: 40px;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-accent-line-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    right: 40px;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 46% 54%;
    gap: 70px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 34px;
    padding: 0 14px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.badge_border }};
    border-radius: 999px;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-badge-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-growth-process-badge-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 110%;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-heading-highlight-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_highlight_color }};
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 34px;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    position: relative;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-growth-process-timeline-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.timeline_title_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.timeline_icon_hover_color }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px {{ block.settings.timeline_icon_hover_color }}40;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-connector-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 38px;
    width: 1px;
    height: calc(100% + 34px);
    background-color: {{ block.settings.timeline_connector_color }};
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child .ai-growth-process-timeline-connector-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.timeline_icon_color }};
    background-color: transparent;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: {{ block.settings.timeline_icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.timeline_title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.timeline_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-timeline-body-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.timeline_body_size }}px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 170%;
    color: {{ block.settings.timeline_body_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 520px;
    height: 540px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
  }

  .ai-growth-process-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: {{ block.settings.image_vertical_alignment }};
    justify-content: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.image_padding }}px;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 100%;
    max-height: 100%;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: center;
    transform: scale({{ block.settings.image_scale | divided_by: 100.0 }});
  }

  .ai-growth-process-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
  }

  .ai-growth-process-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-growth-process-quote-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.quote_size }}px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: {{ block.settings.quote_color }};
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-growth-process-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_mobile }}px 30px;
    }

    .ai-growth-process-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 50px;
    }

    .ai-growth-process-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
    }

    .ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    .ai-growth-process-timeline-connector-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      top: 32px;
    }

    .ai-growth-process-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      min-height: 400px;
    }

    .ai-growth-process-accent-line-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      left: 20px;
    }

    .ai-growth-process-accent-line-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      right: 20px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<ai-growth-process-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-growth-process-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-growth-process-accent-line-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
  <div class="ai-growth-process-accent-line-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
  
  <div class="ai-growth-process-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-growth-process-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-growth-process-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.badge_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-growth-process-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <svg class="ai-growth-process-badge-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon>
            </svg>
            <span class="ai-growth-process-badge-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.badge_text }}</span>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-growth-process-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.heading | replace: block.settings.heading_highlight_text, '<span class="ai-growth-process-heading-highlight-' | append: ai_gen_id | append: '">' | append: block.settings.heading_highlight_text | append: '</span>' }}
          </h2>
        {% endif %}

        <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.timeline_1_enabled %}
            <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-connector-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h3 class="ai-growth-process-timeline-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.timeline_1_title }}</h3>
                <p class="ai-growth-process-timeline-body-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.timeline_1_body }}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.timeline_2_enabled %}
            <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                    <line x1="9" y1="3" x2="9" y2="21"></line>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-connector-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h3 class="ai-growth-process-timeline-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.timeline_2_title }}</h3>
                <p class="ai-growth-process-timeline-body-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.timeline_2_body }}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.timeline_3_enabled %}
            <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline>
                    <polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-connector-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h3 class="ai-growth-process-timeline-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.timeline_3_title }}</h3>
                <p class="ai-growth-process-timeline-body-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.timeline_3_body }}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.timeline_4_enabled %}
            <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <path d="M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z"></path>
                    <path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"></path>
                    <line x1="12" y1="19" x2="12" y2="22"></line>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-connector-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="ai-growth-process-timeline-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h3 class="ai-growth-process-timeline-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.timeline_4_title }}</h3>
                <p class="ai-growth-process-timeline-body-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.timeline_4_body }}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-growth-process-right-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-growth-process-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-growth-process-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.image %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1040 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.image_alt | escape }}"
                class="ai-growth-process-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="{{ block.settings.image.width }}"
                height="{{ block.settings.image.height }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-growth-process-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>

        {% if block.settings.quote_text != blank %}
          <p class="ai-growth-process-quote-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.quote_text }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</ai-growth-process-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class AiGrowthProcess{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.style.display = 'block';
      }
    }

    customElements.define('ai-growth-process-{{ ai_gen_id }}', AiGrowthProcess{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Growth process",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "default": "#050505"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_padding_desktop",
      "label": "Desktop padding",
      "min": 50,
      "max": 150,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_padding_mobile",
      "label": "Mobile padding",
      "min": 30,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "horizontal_padding",
      "label": "Horizontal padding",
      "min": 20,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "desktop_width_percent",
      "label": "Desktop width",
      "min": 50,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Accent lines"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "accent_line_color",
      "label": "Color",
      "default": "#B85C1C"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "accent_line_opacity",
      "label": "Opacity",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Badge"
